    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698370/extras/9eb40f99b049daa4c1d1718f0b66061a.avif?t=1752706485\" width=600 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Knockout Master 2, you continue the story of a wealthy young man with a long-term goal of becoming the world heavyweight boxing champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, your decisions will shape the world and characters around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many beautiful women populate the world of this game and your actions will change your story with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get too comfortable. Dangerous criminals will try to spoil your plans and ruin your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality renders and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Love Interests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smartphone (Text messages, Social media, News, and more!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Phone Wallpapers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music &amp; Sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren'Py Engine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698370/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1752706485\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698370/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1752706485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698370/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1752706485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698370/extras/9eb40f99b049daa4c1d1718f0b66061a.avif?t=1752706485\" width=600 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Knockout Master 2, you continue the story of a wealthy young man with a long-term goal of becoming the world heavyweight boxing champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, your decisions will shape the world and characters around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many beautiful women populate the world of this game and your actions will change your story with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get too comfortable. Dangerous criminals will try to spoil your plans and ruin your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality renders and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Love Interests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smartphone (Text messages, Social media, News, and more!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Phone Wallpapers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music &amp; Sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren'Py Engine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698370/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1752706485\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698370/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1752706485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698370/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1752706485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
